<!doctype lake><title>无标题文档</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="CdOfc" id="CdOfc" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u7b0f7a5f" id="u7b0f7a5f">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="uccf31465" id="uccf31465"> 𝐄𝐀𝐆𝐋𝐄: 𝐒𝐩𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐒𝐚𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐑𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐬 𝐑𝐞𝐭𝐡𝐢𝐧𝐤𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐅𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞 𝐔𝐧𝐜𝐞𝐫𝐭𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐲</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u9c51212b" id="u9c51212b"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9ecbdb5" id="uf9ecbdb5">自回归解码是大语言模型事实上的标准解码方式。由于其按照顺序逐个生成词元，生成过程速度较慢且成本高昂。基于投机采样的方法通过将这一过程划分为低开销的草稿生成阶段，以及对草稿词元进行并行处理的验证阶段，使大语言模型能够在一次前向传播中验证多个词元</span></strong></p><ul list="u5fc3b18e"><li fid="ucf9594bb" data-lake-id="u6d73a754" id="u6d73a754"><span data-lake-id="ub5c6ad4d" id="ub5c6ad4d">这些方法通过在每次前向传播中生成多个词元来加速生成。更重要的是，验证阶段确保生成文本的分布与原始大语言模型的解码结果精确一致，从而保持生成内容的一致性</span></li><li fid="ucf9594bb" data-lake-id="u858ee90c" id="u858ee90c"><span data-lake-id="u5d9ed8ea" id="u5d9ed8ea">应用投机采样的关键，在于找到一个能够近似复现原始大语言模型功能、同时具有更低延迟的草稿模型，通常采用同一大语言模型系列中参数量较小的版本。专门为投机采样训练一个规模适当的新草稿模型，也并非理想的解决方案，因为训练成本高昂</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2696ca1c" id="u2696ca1c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3b399dca" id="u3b399dca">提高投机采样加速效果的关键，在于降低时间开销，并提高草稿被原始大语言模型接受的概率。许多方法着重降低草稿生成阶段的开销</span></strong></p><ul list="u3dbb26e8"><li fid="ub69d949c" data-lake-id="u12b98780" id="u12b98780"><span data-lake-id="u9fbb49cc" id="u9fbb49cc">Lookahead 采用 n-gram 和 Jacobi 迭代，而 Medusa 则利用一组多层感知机，根据原始大语言模型倒数第二层的特征预测词元</span></li><li fid="ub69d949c" data-lake-id="u3ea4b103" id="u3ea4b103"><span data-lake-id="ub1745888" id="ub1745888">这些策略显著降低草稿生成的延迟，从而改善加速效果。然而，所生成草稿的准确率较低，限制这些方法的效果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0ba123df" id="u0ba123df"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf87d821f" id="uf87d821f">为克服上述局限，提出 EAGLE，用于提高语言模型效率的外推算法）。这是一种高效的投机采样方法，其设计基于以下两项观察</span></strong></p><ul list="ub67d4e72"><li fid="u8b5e4bdc" data-lake-id="uf7c3ca2e" id="uf7c3ca2e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0034436e" id="u0034436e">首先，在特征层面进行自回归预测，比在词元层面进行自回归预测更为简单。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7c016460" id="u7c016460">特征指原始大语言模型倒数第二层的特征，即位于语言模型输出头之前的表示。词元序列只是自然语言的简单转换形式，相比之下，特征序列表现出更强的规律性。在特征层面进行自回归预测，再利用原始大语言模型的 LM head 得到词元，其效果优于直接以自回归方式预测词元</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf7341572" id="uf7341572" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791106443466-ed542b60-f65b-455d-9b04-f1405d4ae278.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u88287a3e-4b82-4d38-8a70-be6c41514ba%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u8dd6e13c-a9b8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A540%2C%22height%22%3A170%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A27664%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A675%2C%22originHeight%22%3A212%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(READY)%3DO.7%22%2C%22x%22%3A533%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(EXCITED)%3D0.3%22%2C%22x%22%3A534%2C%22y%22%3A46%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(ALWAYS)%3DO.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A304%2C%22y%22%3A69%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(LOOK)%3D0.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A67%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A103%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(BEGINEO.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A69%2C%22y%22%3A48%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A185%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPING%22%2C%22x%22%3A429%2C%22y%22%3A129%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P(AM)%3D0.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A301%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PALWAYS%22%2C%22x%22%3A74%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALWAYS%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A121%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALWAYS%22%2C%22x%22%3A75%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A71%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PAM%22%2C%22x%22%3A552%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AM%22%2C%22x%22%3A553%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AM%22%2C%22x%22%3A553%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PI%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f3f2%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u61177f97%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc33824fb"><li fid="u2d934301" data-lake-id="u0b1459cd" id="u0b1459cd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u45d3ceb0" id="u45d3ceb0">其次，采样过程固有的不确定性，显著限制下一特征预测的性能。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub115c24d" id="ub115c24d">在文本生成过程中，目标大语言模型预测词元的概率分布，并据此进行采样，从而引入随机性。然而，特征具有高维、连续的性质，无法采用相同的方式处理。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua096018e" id="ua096018e" style="color: #5C0036">采样得到不同的词元，会产生不同的特征序列，从而为特征层面的自回归预测引入歧义。为解决这一问题，EAGLE 将相对于特征序列提前一个时间步的词元序列输入草稿模型，该序列包含采样结果</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="yv4Mj" id="yv4Mj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5138c482" id="u5138c482">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u9cdfbb4b" id="u9cdfbb4b"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u03c44076" id="u03c44076">𝐄𝐱𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐩𝐨𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐀𝐥𝐠𝐨𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐡𝐦 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐆𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐫 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞-𝐦𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="uc0a7bcd9" id="uc0a7bcd9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u88994947" id="u88994947">输入序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_%7B1%3Aj%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb26e46bde7993e25545c9b7c36a21f41.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UiM1h%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub63dfcd2" id="ub63dfcd2">首先通过嵌入层转换为嵌入序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22E_%7B1%3Aj%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef4e1e944dab0e6f7647bc0c7c21c934.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kpVeV%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua89badd1" id="ua89badd1">，随后转换为特征序列</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22F_%7B1%3Aj%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F799b65369e95cae0059ec8bfa86e1b67.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K276k%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a7f91f9" id="u6a7f91f9">。语言模型输出头将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffa1b94607021adba6dd35f69acbce88f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ajr44%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uce989e6d" id="uce989e6d">映射为概率分布 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7Bj%2B1%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BLM%5C%5C_Head%7D(f_j)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8d543d22db84c429510ce4292aa34632.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tmDex%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud9f65d1f" id="ud9f65d1f">，再从该分布中采样得到下一个词元</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bj%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F814e85c605a5a9b1d755bf51c38c715e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J7WFW%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fb6eef6" id="u7fb6eef6">。因此，对于任意整数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22j%5C%5Cgeq%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5ac3c3e0eab77290b0f53c46d3ed6bf9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xPigR%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u46c4587f" id="u46c4587f">，标准的词元级自回归过程可以表示为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u410dba3d" id="u410dba3d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22T_%7B1%3Aj%7D%5C%5Crightarrow%20E_%7B1%3Aj%7D%5C%5Crightarrow%20f_j%5C%5Crightarrow%20p_%7Bj%2B1%7D%5C%5Crightarrow%20t_%7Bj%2B1%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff46e35ba9c9b911ca500ab19ffa85e01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HVkni%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud8615689" id="ud8615689"><strong><span data-lake-id="u27b24d9a" id="u27b24d9a">EAGLE 与其他方法的主要区别集中在草稿生成阶段</span></strong></p><ul list="u0fbe575e"><li fid="ub1f96c65" data-lake-id="u912b91fc" id="u912b91fc"><span data-lake-id="u53c7d606" id="u53c7d606">投机采样和 Lookahead 均根据词元预测词元；Medusa 利用目标大语言模型的特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1fdbe7c84191cb784a4c4ce438bf3d27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g39Jl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a99cb5e" id="u9a99cb5e">，分别独立预测 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6aea8b94ebb6edd43f2e9cd6705a1838.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o3hiU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93692335" id="u93692335">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_5%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc76f3e57849e54734eb2c56803d9401.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22js0Pc%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ub1f96c65" data-lake-id="u72844b25" id="u72844b25"><span data-lake-id="ub0284850" id="ub0284850">EAGLE 则利用特征序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(f_1%2Cf_2)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54c12c61b6e02ace5008179a2df3a179.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZCnaS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0d4a2d6" id="ua0d4a2d6">，以及相对于特征序列提前一个时间步的词元序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(t_2%2Ct_3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F94e5e88053fcaee0685bdce2272d462b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QS8HW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf6e7b9c3" id="uf6e7b9c3">，预测特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb2c8e4c426418c9143ccea57d851f6e7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dncRS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub3249c94" id="ub3249c94">。随后，从分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_4%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BLM%5C%5C_Head%7D(f_3)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbaf970d9f98db2e99dadc173220227c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iNEuH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b0fabc2" id="u9b0fabc2">中采样得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6aea8b94ebb6edd43f2e9cd6705a1838.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SvdDN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u95edbf5a" id="u95edbf5a">。接着，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_3%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb2c8e4c426418c9143ccea57d851f6e7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eOzv7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c54e554" id="u3c54e554">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6aea8b94ebb6edd43f2e9cd6705a1838.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fxa7X%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u314442f6" id="u314442f6">追加至输入序列，以预测下一特征</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_4%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffee952fc0ba720c44b3e8efed3cfe7b7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tWi6o%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u451c20ef" id="u451c20ef">，并采样得到后续词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_5%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc76f3e57849e54734eb2c56803d9401.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h7Fh7%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uebf67ca3" id="uebf67ca3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791107750073-257b61c4-ac24-44c8-a8e3-0511fe1f020f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u848f5879-1581-4291-80f9-32c027c6bd1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2d151935-ca32-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A620%2C%22height%22%3A221%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A60680%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A775%2C%22originHeight%22%3A276%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22AUTO-REGRESSIONHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A466%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AUTO-REGRESSIONHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A468%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A159%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGLAYER%26%22%2C%22x%22%3A475%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PECULATIVESAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A88%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222-GRAM%2CJACOBI%22%2C%22x%22%3A520%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOKAHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A523%2C%22y%22%3A18%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222-GRAM%2CJACOBI%22%2C%22x%22%3A519%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGLAYER%26%22%2C%22x%22%3A475%2C%22y%22%3A213%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SMALLERLLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A191%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSA%22%2C%22x%22%3A105%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSAHEAD2%22%2C%22x%22%3A98%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SMALLERLLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A110%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EAGLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A512%2C%22y%22%3A122%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEDUSAHEAD1%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A394%2C%22y%22%3A201%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A58%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A54%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8D%81T4%22%2C%22x%22%3A656%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A318%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B1%8B%E4%B8%80T%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2245%22%2C%22x%22%3A318%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T5%22%2C%22x%22%3A673%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AD%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A17%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A394%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A16%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T4%22%2C%22x%22%3A320%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T9%22%2C%22x%22%3A49%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T4%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0ece5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udf23877a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22latex%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%9AHow%20can%20%E2%86%92%20f_can%20%E2%86%92%20LMHead%20%E2%86%92%20softmax%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%87%87%E6%A0%B7%20I%5Cn%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%9AS%20%3D%20%5Bf_How%2C%20f_can%5D%EF%BC%8CE%20%3D%20%5Be_can%2C%20e_I%5D%5Cn%5Cn%E6%AF%8F%E8%BD%AE%E8%8D%89%E7%A8%BF%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%EF%BC%9A%E9%85%8D%E5%AF%B9%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%20%E2%86%92%20Concat%20%E2%86%92%20FC%20%E2%86%92%20DraftDecoder%20%E2%86%92%20%E5%8F%96%E6%9C%AB%E4%BD%8D%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%5Cn%5Cn%E7%AC%AC%201%20%E8%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%E9%85%8D%E5%AF%B9%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%20%3D%20%5B(f_How%2C%20e_can)%2C%20(f_can%2C%20e_I)%5D%5Cn%20%20%E6%9C%AB%E4%BD%8D%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20f_hat_I%20%E2%86%92%20LMHead%20%E2%86%92%20softmax%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%87%87%E6%A0%B7%20do%5Cn%20%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%20S%20%3D%20%5Bf_How%2C%20f_can%2C%20f_hat_I%5D%EF%BC%8CE%20%3D%20%5Be_can%2C%20e_I%2C%20e_do%5D%5Cn%5Cn%E7%AC%AC%202%20%E8%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%E9%85%8D%E5%AF%B9%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%20%3D%20%5B(f_How%2C%20e_can)%2C%20(f_can%2C%20e_I)%2C%20(f_hat_I%2C%20e_do)%5D%5Cn%20%20%E6%9C%AB%E4%BD%8D%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20f_hat_do%20%E2%86%92%20LMHead%20%E2%86%92%20softmax%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%87%87%E6%A0%B7%20it%5Cn%20%20%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%20S%20%3D%20%5Bf_How%2C%20f_can%2C%20f_hat_I%2C%20f_hat_do%5D%EF%BC%8CE%20%3D%20%5Be_can%2C%20e_I%2C%20e_do%2C%20e_it%5D%5Cn%5Cn%E7%AC%AC%203%20%E8%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%E5%9C%A8%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E9%85%8D%E5%AF%B9%20(f_hat_do%2C%20e_it)%5Cn%20%20%E6%9C%AB%E4%BD%8D%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%20f_hat_it%20%E2%86%92%20LMHead%20%E2%86%92%20softmax%20%E2%86%92%20%E9%87%87%E6%A0%B7%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%8D%89%E7%A8%BF%20token%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PrGSo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%7D" hindent="2em"></card><p data-lake-id="u51581a5c" id="u51581a5c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u03d64b4d" id="u03d64b4d">EAGLE 的草稿模型由三个模块组成：嵌入层、语言模型输出头和自回归头。嵌入层和语言模型输出头使用目标大语言模型的参数，无需额外训练。草稿模型接收两个输入：形状为</span></strong><code data-lake-id="u0f497e11" id="u0f497e11"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueb0d034f" id="ueb0d034f">(bs, seq_len, hidden_dim)</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id="u327509d2" id="u327509d2">的特征序列，以及形状为</span></strong><code data-lake-id="ub31c4904" id="ub31c4904"><strong><span data-lake-id="u21d054d6" id="u21d054d6">(bs, seq_len)</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id="ue683963e" id="ue683963e"> 的、提前一个时间步的词元序列</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3809efe8" id="u3809efe8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791107879639-77d370bb-a4b8-4957-8a89-981ae332d1e6.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6162f463-4e5c-4925-b90a-17ceed7513d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2d151935-ca32-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A442.79998779296875%2C%22height%22%3A323%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A42152%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A731%2C%22originHeight%22%3A533%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDINGLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A262%2C%22y%22%3A426%2C%22width%22%3A179%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DECODERLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A277%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A490%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FCLAYER%22%2C%22x%22%3A305%2C%22y%22%3A212%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A278%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DROP%22%2C%22x%22%3A154%2C%22y%22%3A434%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EF1%22%2C%22x%22%3A270%2C%22y%22%3A150%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%5BE2%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A279%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EF2%22%2C%22x%22%3A396%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E3%22%2C%22x%22%3A369%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F2%22%2C%22x%22%3A427%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8E%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A304%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A21%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E3%22%2C%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A375%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E2%22%2C%22x%22%3A274%2C%22y%22%3A376%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T3%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A487%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F%22%2C%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbfafa%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2e7e89e2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3f7a0451"><li fid="uaec07853" data-lake-id="u76f8b4ef" id="u76f8b4ef"><span data-lake-id="uf07fc675" id="uf07fc675">词元序列转换为形状为</span><code data-lake-id="u7fba6768" id="u7fba6768"><span data-lake-id="u8968370a" id="u8968370a">(bs, seq_len, hidden_dim)</span></code><span data-lake-id="ub16a703f" id="ub16a703f">的词元嵌入序列；与特征序列拼接，得到形状为</span><code data-lake-id="u93387ea4" id="u93387ea4"><span data-lake-id="u4895d391" id="u4895d391">(bs, seq_len, 2 × hidden_dim)</span></code><span data-lake-id="ua60aff23" id="ua60aff23">的融合序列</span></li><li fid="uaec07853" data-lake-id="u3f5da47f" id="u3f5da47f"><span data-lake-id="ub1b0d69e" id="ub1b0d69e">自回归头由一个全连接层和一个解码器层组成。全连接层将融合序列的形状降为</span><code data-lake-id="u670066ea" id="u670066ea"><span data-lake-id="ube432db6" id="ube432db6">(bs, seq_len, hidden_dim)</span></code><span data-lake-id="u145c047c" id="u145c047c">，随后由解码器层预测下一特征。语言模型输出头根据该特征计算概率分布，并从中采样得到下一个词元。最后，将预测特征和采样得到的词元追加至输入，以继续执行自回归过程</span></li><li fid="uaec07853" data-lake-id="ub024adc3" id="ub024adc3"><span data-lake-id="uccc29564" id="uccc29564">EAGLE 使用树形注意力构建树形草稿，通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22evDnT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8a31242" id="ud8a31242">次前向传播生成深度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RRsUu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe883c63" id="ufe883c63">、词元数量超过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xrBLq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u014f038e" id="u014f038e">的草稿树</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9e9ed5e2" id="u9e9ed5e2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791107911965-e2cae864-a05e-4d95-8164-44b0860d62d7.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u26aecca2-e81b-4930-afc6-b58b7c93a0e%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2d151935-ca32-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A528%2C%22height%22%3A217%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A46932%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A660%2C%22originHeight%22%3A271%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLINGUSINGORIGINALLLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEATEXTRAPOLATOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A141%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD2%22%2C%22x%22%3A486%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD3%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A202%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD1%22%2C%22x%22%3A490%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTINGUSING%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOWCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A221%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD1%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A97%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUERY%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAKE%22%2C%22x%22%3A174%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A275%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A425%2C%22y%22%3A253%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%87%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A335%2C%22y%22%3A141%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A7%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A395%2C%22y%22%3A179%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE%22%2C%22x%22%3A244%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOUR!%22%2C%22x%22%3A305%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A422%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A402%2C%22y%22%3A164%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OU%22%2C%22x%22%3A213%2C%22y%22%3A181%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B9%BF2%22%2C%22x%22%3A404%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f5%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue807d275%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u99f6345f" id="u99f6345f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1435ffde" id="u1435ffde">草稿模型的训练：预测下一特征属于回归任务，因此，采用 Smooth L1 损失</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u146b4f0e" id="u146b4f0e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Breg%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSmoothL1%7D%5C%5Cleft(f_%7Bi%2B1%7D%2C%5C%5Coperatorname%7BDraft%5C%5C_Model%7D%5C%5Cleft(T_%7B2%3Ai%2B1%7D%2CF_%7B1%3Ai%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4931749ce8412e44a8c05d47d8d6a9c6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rbLTV%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua1d92a8a"><li fid="u18daf5f3" data-lake-id="u48f29da5" id="u48f29da5"><span data-lake-id="uc8a91e89" id="uc8a91e89">特征预测是草稿模型的中间目标，其最终目标是通过预测词元来生成词元序列。因此采用分类损失，直接针对这一最终目标进行优化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u711c087c" id="u711c087c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7Bi%2B2%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BLM%5C%5C_Head%7D%5C%5Cleft(f_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a6a3c7bb954d01c33e2bca89a7a5a76.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bDlax%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u61202119" id="u61202119" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bp%7D_%7Bi%2B2%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Coperatorname%7BLM%5C%5C_Head%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Chat%7Bf%7D_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95c1f2a5a60fc3db5201a173b184c04e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZJbRc%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u64da83d4" id="u64da83d4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcls%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BCross%5C%5C_Entropy%7D%5C%5Cleft(p_%7Bi%2B2%7D%2C%5C%5Chat%7Bp%7D_%7Bi%2B2%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb2d0649d5020fbda8415c35b0aa03aa3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mmDdH%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u41342134"><li fid="u988ff3b2" data-lake-id="ueab80257" id="ueab80257"><span data-lake-id="ua6f9f203" id="ua6f9f203">结合回归损失和分类损失，使用联合损失函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22L%3DL_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Breg%7D%7D%2Bw_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcls%7D%7DL_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcls%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F90449812e9822b4a48953b43a92320db.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZaUot%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b11cbbd" id="u9b11cbbd">训练自回归头。通常，分类损失在数值上比回归损失大一个数量级</span></li><li fid="u988ff3b2" data-lake-id="ub472518d" id="ub472518d"><span data-lake-id="u1995daa4" id="u1995daa4">理想情况下，EAGLE 的自回归头应当使用目标大语言模型以自回归方式生成的文本进行训练，但这种方式开销较高。所幸，EAGLE 对训练数据的敏感性较低。不使用目标大语言模型生成的文本，而是采用固定的数据集，从而显著降低开销</span></li><li fid="u988ff3b2" data-lake-id="u6a468a9e" id="u6a468a9e"><span data-lake-id="u7bd1f1e8" id="u7bd1f1e8">在草稿生成阶段，EAGLE 在特征层面执行自回归预测，而特征预测的不准确可能导致误差累积。为缓解这一问题，采用数据增强：在训练过程中，向目标大语言模型的特征添加从均匀分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BU%7D(-0.1%2C0.1)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f76562e37245265c4bb155c25ce5525.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bZhBK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9601c62d" id="u9601c62d">中采样的随机噪声</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u651f530c" id="u651f530c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791108137338-93db0f9b-3cd8-4179-9b1e-7224e75ee3b4.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u078f151b-822b-43d3-be01-7218ab4267a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2d151935-ca32-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A642.4%2C%22height%22%3A474%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A106825%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A803%2C%22originHeight%22%3A592%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ONEAUTO-REGRESSIONHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A410%2C%22y%22%3A283%2C%22width%22%3A195%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLINGMULTIPLETIMES%22%2C%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A173%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A464%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMBEDDING%22%2C%22x%22%3A460%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A3%AB%22%2C%22x%22%3A326%2C%22y%22%3A456%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A51%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TARGETLLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A562%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD2%22%2C%22x%22%3A471%2C%22y%22%3A528%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD1%22%2C%22x%22%3A298%2C%22y%22%3A527%2C%22width%22%3A80%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD3%22%2C%22x%22%3A634%2C%22y%22%3A527%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORWARD1%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A527%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LMHEAD%22%2C%22x%22%3A469%2C%22y%22%3A156%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TRANSFORME%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LAVERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A302%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAKE%22%2C%22x%22%3A350%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAKE%22%2C%22x%22%3A445%2C%22y%22%3A483%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITH%2F%22%2C%22x%22%3A530%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A626%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A623%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAK%22%2C%22x%22%3A449%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ECAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A111%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A624%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EMAKE%22%2C%22x%22%3A447%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A355%2C%22y%22%3A42%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EHELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A525%2C%22y%22%3A380%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A702%2C%22y%22%3A356%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A526%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CWITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A621%2C%22y%22%3A382%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A266%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITH%22%2C%22x%22%3A622%2C%22y%22%3A480%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A698%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A105%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22JCAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A357%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TO%22%2C%22x%22%3A704%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HELP%22%2C%22x%22%3A529%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A531%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOUR%22%2C%22x%22%3A624%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EHOW%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ECAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A269%2C%22y%22%3A382%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A706%2C%22y%22%3A382%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A705%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A264%2C%22y%22%3A482%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUI%22%2C%22x%22%3A458%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A457%2C%22y%22%3A322%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22x%22%3A462%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A699%2C%22y%22%3A484%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CAN%22%2C%22x%22%3A112%2C%22y%22%3A209%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%9A%22%2C%22x%22%3A402%2C%22y%22%3A421%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22122%22%2C%22x%22%3A630%2C%22y%22%3A508%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221%22%2C%22x%22%3A459%2C%22y%22%3A509%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f4f0ec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2e958a8a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u50212693" id="u50212693"><strong><span data-lake-id="u812e6f23" id="u812e6f23" style="color: #DF2A3F">借助树形注意力，目标大语言模型仅需一次前向传播，即可计算树形草稿中每个词元的概率。在草稿树的每个节点上，递归应用投机采样算法进行采样或调整分布。处理方式与 SpecInfer 一致，能够确保输出文本的分布与目标大语言模型的分布保持一致。同时记录被接受的词元及其特征，供下一轮草稿生成使用</span></strong></p><h1 data-lake-id="lsFUZ" id="lsFUZ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u545191b7" id="u545191b7">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="ua4542449" id="ua4542449"> 𝐄𝐀𝐆𝐋𝐄-𝟐: 𝐅𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐫 𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐃𝐲𝐧𝐚𝐦𝐢𝐜 𝐃𝐫𝐚𝐟𝐭 𝐓𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uf8a95357" id="uf8a95357"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c5259c5" id="u8c5259c5">投机采样旨在通过快速生成草稿词元，再对其进行并行验证来解决这一问题。这类方法能够在一次前向传播中生成多个词元，从而显著降低推理延迟</span></strong></p><ul list="ubdba6ef5"><li fid="u3286a6da" data-lake-id="u1eac3787" id="u1eac3787"><span data-lake-id="u627483fe" id="u627483fe">标准投机采样采用链式结构的草稿。为增加接受长度，近期的投机采样研究开始采用树形结构的草稿。Sequoia 明确假设，草稿词元的接受率仅取决于其在树中的位置</span></li><li fid="u3286a6da" data-lake-id="ua0739921" id="ua0739921"><span data-lake-id="ubfaeadb1" id="ubfaeadb1">EAGLE 和 Medusa 则在所有上下文中使用相同的静态草稿树结构：在草稿生成阶段的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E0Qhd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5f810c8" id="ub5f810c8">步，添加</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zrZSf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u95c2a39b" id="u95c2a39b">个候选，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SwGYK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6326328c" id="u6326328c">为固定值。这实际上隐含上述假设。然而，这一假设似乎与投机采样所依据的认识相矛盾，即某些词元更易预测，可以由较小的模型完成预测</span></li><li fid="u3286a6da" data-lake-id="u59166ea4" id="u59166ea4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u150a2fd0" id="u150a2fd0" style="color: #DF2A3F">实验表明，草稿词元的接受率不仅取决于位置，而且高度依赖于上下文。因此，静态草稿树结构存在固有的局限性。根据不同上下文中草稿词元的接受率，动态调整草稿树结构，可以获得更好的效果</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u994b93fb" id="u994b93fb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u98cf52c4" id="u98cf52c4">获取草稿词元的接受率需要原始大语言模型的前向计算结果，这与投机采样旨在减少原始大语言模型前向传播次数的目标相冲突。所幸 EAGLE 具有良好的校准性：草稿模型的置信度分数能够较好地近似草稿词元的接受率。这一发现使得采用依赖上下文的动态草稿树结构成为可能</span></strong></p><ul list="u2b1c5d7d"><li fid="uec91d3de" data-lake-id="ucf0c1d05" id="ucf0c1d05"><span data-lake-id="u3b9d1c1c" id="u3b9d1c1c">EAGLE-2 利用草稿模型的置信度分数近似估计接受率，并据此动态调整草稿树结构，从而增加被接受的词元数量</span></li></ul><ul list="ufb2b0cfa"><li fid="u01c7e891" data-lake-id="u1e0557ef" id="u1e0557ef"><span data-lake-id="uf8dc1d48" id="uf8dc1d48">相较于 EAGLE，EAGLE-2 无需训练任何额外模型。它不单独训练用于预测草稿树结构的模型，而是根据投机采样所需的草稿模型输出的置信度分数，调整草稿树结构。因此，EAGLE-2 无需额外训练</span></li><li fid="u01c7e891" data-lake-id="u8a7f50a0" id="u8a7f50a0"><span data-lake-id="uf645cf8d" id="uf645cf8d">EAGLE-2 不对原始大语言模型进行微调或参数更新，也不放宽接受条件。可以从理论上保证，生成文本的分布与原始大语言模型的分布完全一致</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub9e585db" id="ub9e585db" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791110864073-80a86843-70a3-4de2-ade7-a0c67486cf42.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u016a8eae-852b-4e36-b2a7-279b6e6ea4a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub759f532-a4eb-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A912%2C%22height%22%3A142%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A67434%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1497%2C%22originHeight%22%3A233%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22B)VERIFICATIONSTAGE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1107%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A253%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(A)DRAFTINGSTAGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A208%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SPECULATIVESAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A982%2C%22y%22%3A29%2C%22width%22%3A211%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PECULATIVESAMPLING%22%2C%22x%22%3A155%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A205%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKENAUTOREGRESSIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A165%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A167%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KENAUTOREGRESSIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A176%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TUREAUTOREGRE%22%2C%22x%22%3A626%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TUREAUTOREGRESS%22%2C%22x%22%3A624%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A638%2C%22y%22%3A75%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A183%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A125%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A190%2C%22y%22%3A143%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B1%8B%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A817%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DRAFTMODEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A638%2C%22y%22%3A142%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B4%E4%B8%80%22%2C%22x%22%3A811%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1039%2C%22y%22%3A86%2C%22width%22%3A86%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EAGLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A646%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ORIGINAL%22%2C%22x%22%3A1322%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EAGLE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1322%2C%22y%22%3A26%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22F%E5%90%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A486%2C%22y%22%3A145%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A1329%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A1263%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22x%22%3A491%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LLM%22%2C%22x%22%3A1060%2C%22y%22%3A107%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRESSIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A708%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOKEI%22%2C%22x%22%3A157%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A48%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ESSIVE%22%2C%22x%22%3A725%2C%22y%22%3A123%2C%22width%22%3A55%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FF%22%2C%22x%22%3A441%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FEATU%22%2C%22x%22%3A596%2C%22y%22%3A56%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TZT3%22%2C%22x%22%3A442%2C%22y%22%3A120%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T3%22%2C%22x%22%3A64%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f1ec%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua512b583%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="nHGfQ" id="nHGfQ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u217699b1" id="u217699b1">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u1c1190d3" id="u1c1190d3"> 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐱𝐭-𝐃𝐞𝐩𝐞𝐧𝐝𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐀𝐜𝐜𝐞𝐩𝐭𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐑𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u37254e57" id="u37254e57"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud48f6ecf" id="ud48f6ecf">首先，评估采用动态草稿树的必要性。这取决于草稿词元的接受率是否仅与其所在位置有关</span></strong></p><ul list="u8d61d9a9"><li fid="u803ff2e9" data-lake-id="u9e231abf" id="u9e231abf"><span data-lake-id="u83adb071" id="u83adb071">使用 Vicuna 7B，在 Alpaca 数据集上测试草稿树中不同位置词元的接受率。总体而言，草稿词元的接受率具有位置依赖性：位置 P1 的接受率最高，位置 P6 的接受率最低。草稿树左上方的词元具有较高的接受率，而右下方的词元的接受率较低。这为 EAGLE 和 Medusa 等方法所采用的静态草稿树中</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u408ff0df" id="u408ff0df">左上方配置较多节点、右下方配置较少节点</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u102097a4" id="u102097a4">的设计提供合理性依据</span></li><li fid="u803ff2e9" data-lake-id="ue01153aa" id="ue01153aa"><span data-lake-id="ud51e4a5c" id="ud51e4a5c">同一位置的接受率存在较大的方差，表明草稿词元被接受的概率不仅取决于其位置，还取决于上下文。这说明，与静态草稿树相比，上下文感知的动态草稿树具有更大的潜力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub977f9d8" id="ub977f9d8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791110787063-0543cba3-dcc0-4b0f-a25b-3f487f5e6a44.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u826cf2d0-dede-4b56-8d0a-d5e6c3090d1%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ub759f532-a4eb-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A683%2C%22height%22%3A207%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A83198%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1470%2C%22originHeight%22%3A446%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22WITHEACHPOINTREPRESENTING%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A372%2C%22width%22%3A333%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A)DRAFTTREESTRUCTURE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A29%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A281%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KENSATDIFFERENTPOSITIONS%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A339%2C%22width%22%3A342%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(BACCEPTANCERATESOFTO-%22%2C%22x%22%3A401%2C%22y%22%3A306%2C%22width%22%3A336%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AGUERY.%22%2C%22x%22%3A403%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A794%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A115%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUERY%22%2C%22x%22%3A129%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P4P5P6%22%2C%22x%22%3A65%2C%22y%22%3A332%2C%22width%22%3A246%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONFIDENCE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1103%2C%22y%22%3A422%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A853%2C%22y%22%3A392%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A942%2C%22y%22%3A393%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1084%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A1120%2C%22y%22%3A395%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22P3%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A334%2C%22width%22%3A60%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A820%2C%22y%22%3A34%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A1264%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A816%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.01%22%2C%22x%22%3A423%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22POSITION%22%2C%22x%22%3A502%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A108%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A809%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A60%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.6%22%2C%22x%22%3A408%2C%22y%22%3A99%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.%22%2C%22x%22%3A813%2C%22y%22%3A171%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A817%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A400%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u09cd6412%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2fdce310" id="u2fdce310"><strong><span data-lake-id="udfb88b35" id="udfb88b35">为采用动态草稿树，需要一种低开销的方法，在不调用原始大语言模型的情况下估计草稿词元的接受率。在 Alpaca 数据集上开展实验，探究草稿模型的置信度分数（即语言模型为各个词元输出的概率）与接受率之间的关系</span></strong></p><ul list="ub1eeb6e1"><li fid="ued709ef4" data-lake-id="u2dad256b" id="u2dad256b"><span data-lake-id="u4f250f0d" id="u4f250f0d">草稿模型的置信度分数与词元接受率之间存在较强的正相关关系。置信度分数低于 0.05 的草稿词元，其接受率约为 0.04；而置信度分数高于 0.95 的草稿词元，其接受率约为 0.98。可以使用草稿模型的置信度分数估计接受率，而无需引入额外开销，从而实现对草稿树的动态调整</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="Esl5T" id="Esl5T" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ued7f4c7f" id="ued7f4c7f">🪐 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐱𝐭-𝐀𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐃𝐲𝐧𝐚𝐦𝐢𝐜 𝐃𝐫𝐚𝐟𝐭 𝐓𝐫𝐞𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u87d7e06a" id="u87d7e06a"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0fa85bb" id="uc0fa85bb">基于上述观察，作者提出 EAGLE-2，这是一种通过动态调整草稿树来加速大语言模型推理的算法。EAGLE-2 不改变草稿模型的训练与推理方式，也不改变验证阶段。其改进集中在两个方面：如何扩展草稿树，以及如何对草稿词元进行重排序</span></strong></p><ul list="ua670f2d7"><li fid="u61f9d0bd" data-lake-id="uc02b0aac" id="uc02b0aac"><span data-lake-id="u33af992e" id="u33af992e">在扩展阶段，将草稿树最新一层中最有希望被接受的节点输入草稿模型，以构建下一层。在重排序阶段，选择接受概率较高的词元，构成验证阶段中原始大语言模型的输入</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u231da04c" id="u231da04c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u87acb661" id="u87acb661">借助树形注意力，草稿模型可以同时接收当前层的全部词元，并在一次前向传播中计算后续词元的概率，从而扩展当前层的所有词元。然而，一次输入过多词元会减慢草稿模型的前向计算，而且草稿树各层的词元数量会呈指数增长。因此，需要对草稿树进行选择性扩展</span></strong></p><ul list="ubaaefd2b"><li fid="ufb1ac2b3" data-lake-id="u50754d33" id="u50754d33"><span data-lake-id="u8438c827" id="u8438c827">从当前层中选择全局接受概率最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pIpBc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u83e4629f" id="u83e4629f">个词元进行扩展。在投机采样中，拒绝一个草稿词元会导致其后所有词元被丢弃；只有当前缀中的所有词元均被接受时，该词元才会最终被接受。词元</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fCpPL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd8b0f03" id="udd8b0f03">的全局接受率，等于从根节点到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A8HxI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uceee92db" id="uceee92db">的路径上所有词元接受率的乘积。将其定义为节点的价值分数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F588455b04479646f6b7a4a2886b01dba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22daFYo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5eddcb0" id="ua5eddcb0">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua97e7d5b" id="ua97e7d5b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V_i%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt_j%5C%5Cin%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPath%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7Broot%7D%2Ct_i)%7Dp_j%5C%5Capprox%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt_j%5C%5Cin%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPath%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7Broot%7D%2Ct_i)%7Dc_j.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4eee80d8237918e60bb0dcbe3c835b80.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aGfrL%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue73b41cf"><li fid="u704d54c7" data-lake-id="u6d5164ed" id="u6d5164ed"><span data-lake-id="u7831d40f" id="u7831d40f">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPath%7D(%5C%5Cmathrm%7Broot%7D%2Ct_i)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22ad302434ac8b5b1ab26ce4a250d3c3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VZJds%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8194b517" id="u8194b517">表示草稿树中从根节点到节点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26e255f82b8cc1651e50a820c5a16dc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yxftL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue94ec76e" id="ue94ec76e">的路径，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffbebc57f75af88ed6c9a0f7c946502b2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22joMuM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf78965e2" id="uf78965e2">表示节点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb072eec5eadb81ad251f19d7965d661.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JqMch%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c771cbb" id="u7c771cbb">的接受率，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22c_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0b5db9591b49e8c481f08e2cf9baabdb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nP1VA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucacc7107" id="ucacc7107">表示草稿模型对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t_j%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb072eec5eadb81ad251f19d7965d661.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ajqP7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4db35aa" id="ue4db35aa">给出的置信度分数。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua763ac3b" id="ua763ac3b" style="color: #5C0036">置信度分数与接受率之间存在较强的正相关关系。利用这一关系，对节点的价值分数进行近似估计</span></strong></li><li fid="u704d54c7" data-lake-id="ua8cf4e98" id="ua8cf4e98"><span data-lake-id="u857b67d3" id="u857b67d3">从价值分数较高的词元开始的分支，更有可能被接受。选择最新一层中价值分数最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TMfQC%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03cd55e3" id="u03cd55e3">个节点作为草稿模型的输入，并根据其输出扩展草稿树</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udda709bd" id="udda709bd"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue9ab3856" id="ue9ab3856">扩展阶段的目的是增加草稿树的深度。由于接受率的取值范围为 0 到 1，路径上更深位置的词元具有更低的价值分数。某些未被扩展的浅层节点，其价值分数可能高于已经扩展出的深层节点</span></strong></p><ul list="uf4c7e79d"><li fid="ud40ff10c" data-lake-id="uedad9f24" id="uedad9f24"><span data-lake-id="u93ab8e81" id="u93ab8e81">不直接将扩展阶段选中的词元作为最终草稿，而是对所有草稿词元进行重排序，并选择价值分数最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lO5Nj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubfbcb3e4" id="ubfbcb3e4">个词元。一个节点的价值分数始终小于或等于其父节点的价值分数。对于价值分数相同的节点，优先选择深度较小的节点。这确保重排序后选出的前</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22m%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4760e2f007e23d820825ba241c47ce3b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cZE6S%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u12b4cc6d" id="u12b4cc6d">个词元仍然构成一棵连通的树</span></li><li fid="ud40ff10c" data-lake-id="ud17b0996" id="ud17b0996"><span data-lake-id="u3bde21bd" id="u3bde21bd">随后，将选中的词元展平为一维序列，作为验证阶段的输入。为确保与标准自回归解码保持一致，还需要调整注意力掩码。在标准自回归解码中，每个词元都可以看到此前的所有词元，因此注意力矩阵呈下三角结构。当使用草稿树时，不同分支上的词元不应彼此可见。因此，必须根据树结构调整注意力掩码，确保每个词元只能看到其祖先节点</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucf478f17" id="ucf478f17"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1791111210610-dc39f27b-138b-4a95-9d3a-264b01d4c45c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub5e1f240-5106-4358-87cb-6d084acf920%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u08ca6f86-6840-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A493.6%2C%22height%22%3A474%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A59844%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A617%2C%22originHeight%22%3A593%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22RERANKTOP-8)%22%2C%22x%22%3A206%2C%22y%22%3A323%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EXPANDTOP-2%22%2C%22x%22%3A200%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A171%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G00D(0.34)%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A549%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ICE(0.05)%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A242%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO(0.03)%22%2C%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G00D(0.34)%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A243%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A(0.02)%22%2C%22x%22%3A419%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE(0.06)%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A488%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TO(0.14)%22%2C%22x%22%3A303%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TO(0.14)%22%2C%22x%22%3A311%2C%22y%22%3A488%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HAS(0.2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A383%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HAS(0.2)%22%2C%22x%22%3A374%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DO(0.03)%22%2C%22x%22%3A421%2C%22y%22%3A546%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THE(0.06)%22%2C%22x%22%3A169%2C%22y%22%3A185%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BE(0.08)%22%2C%22x%22%3A296%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BE(0.08)%22%2C%22x%22%3A306%2C%22y%22%3A548%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ICE(0.05)%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A547%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22A(0.02